{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-83150","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115271","text":"RuneFort Interactive Layer — Build Order"}]},{"id":"blk-83151","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115272","text":"Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-83152","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115273","text":"Six prompts that transform RuneFort from a static fort visualizer into an interactive playground with BYOK chat, MCP tool connections, token flow animations, repo import, and workspace management."}]},{"id":"blk-83153","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115274","text":"Dependency Graph"}]},{"id":"blk-83154","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"RFORT-1 (BYOK) ──────┐\n                      ├── RFORT-3 (Chat) ── RFORT-4 (Token Flows)\nRFORT-2 (MCP) ───────┘\nRFORT-5 (Repo Import) ── standalone, uses fort generator\nRFORT-6 (Workspaces) ── standalone, uses auth + supabase"},{"id":"blk-83155","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115275","text":"Recommended Session Plan"}]},{"id":"blk-83156","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115276","text":"Session A: Foundation (RFORT-1 + RFORT-2)"}]},{"id":"blk-83157","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115277","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115278","text":": \"Build RFORT-1 and RFORT-2. Read "},{"id":"spn-115279","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-1_BYOK.md"},{"id":"spn-115280","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-115281","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-2_MCP.md"},{"id":"spn-115282","text":" for full specs. These are the foundation — BYOK key storage and MCP proxy/client. Port patterns from "},{"id":"spn-115283","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/lib/play/"},{"id":"spn-115284","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-115285","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/routes/api/play/mcp-proxy/"},{"id":"spn-115286","text":". Verify: API key modal opens, key persists in localStorage, MCP proxy forwards to graphonomous-mcp.fly.dev, tool discovery returns tools.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83158","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115287","text":"Session B: Chat (RFORT-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-83159","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115288","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115289","text":": \"Build RFORT-3. Read "},{"id":"spn-115290","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-3_CHAT.md"},{"id":"spn-115291","text":" for full spec. Add the chat panel with tool-use loop. The chat should use the BYOK OpenRouter key (from RFORT-1), call MCP tools via the proxy (from RFORT-2), and execute built-in fort navigation tools that zoom/navigate the fort view. Verify: chat sends messages via OpenRouter, tool calls work (both MCP and built-in), fort navigation tools zoom the view.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83160","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115292","text":"Session C: Token Flows (RFORT-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-83161","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115293","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115294","text":": \"Build RFORT-4. Read "},{"id":"spn-115295","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-4_TOKENFLOWS.md"},{"id":"spn-115296","text":" for full spec. Add animated particles on Svelte Flow edges representing token throughput. Include a benchmark simulation mode that cascades flows through PULSE phases. Verify: particles animate along edges, speed/color respond to metrics, simulation runs through all phases.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83162","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115297","text":"Session D: Repo Import (RFORT-5)"}]},{"id":"blk-83163","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115298","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115299","text":": \"Build RFORT-5. Read "},{"id":"spn-115300","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-5_REPO_IMPORT.md"},{"id":"spn-115301","text":" for full spec. Add GitHub repo import that converts repository structure into a fort. Directories → rooms, files → tiles, package manifests → gates. Verify: paste a GitHub URL, import generates a navigable fort, zoom works on imported fort.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83164","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115302","text":"Session E: Workspaces (RFORT-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-83165","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115303","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115304","text":": \"Build RFORT-6. Read "},{"id":"spn-115305","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-6_WORKSPACES.md"},{"id":"spn-115306","text":" for full spec. Add workspace switching tied to amp.workspaces. Each workspace shows its own district of saved forts. Verify: workspace dropdown shows user's workspaces, switching reloads forts, demo mode works without auth.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83166","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115307","text":"Context for All Sessions"}]},{"id":"blk-83167","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83169","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115308","marks":["bold"],"text":"Framework"},{"id":"spn-115309","text":": SvelteKit 2.x + Svelte 5 (runes: "},{"id":"spn-115310","marks":["code"],"text":"$state"},{"id":"spn-115311","text":", "},{"id":"spn-115312","marks":["code"],"text":"$props"},{"id":"spn-115313","text":", "},{"id":"spn-115314","marks":["code"],"text":"$effect"},{"id":"spn-115315","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-83168","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83171","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115316","marks":["bold"],"text":"Flow lib"},{"id":"spn-115317","text":": "},{"id":"spn-115318","marks":["code"],"text":"@xyflow/svelte"},{"id":"spn-115319","text":" v1.5.0"}]}],"id":"blk-83170","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83173","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115320","marks":["bold"],"text":"Style"},{"id":"spn-115321","text":": Dark theme, zinc-900 bg, amber-400 accents"}]}],"id":"blk-83172","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83175","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115322","marks":["bold"],"text":"SSR"},{"id":"spn-115323","text":": Disabled on "},{"id":"spn-115324","marks":["code"],"text":"/app"},{"id":"spn-115325","text":" route ("},{"id":"spn-115326","marks":["code"],"text":"export const ssr = false"},{"id":"spn-115327","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-83174","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83177","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115328","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase"},{"id":"spn-115329","text":": Lazy client via "},{"id":"spn-115330","marks":["code"],"text":"getSupabase()"},{"id":"spn-115331","text":" (returns null during SSR)"}]}],"id":"blk-83176","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83179","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115332","marks":["bold"],"text":"Existing code"},{"id":"spn-115333","text":": Marketing site + 5-level fort editor already built (see "},{"id":"spn-115334","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-115335","text":" tree)"}]}],"id":"blk-83178","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83181","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115336","marks":["bold"],"text":"BendScript reference"},{"id":"spn-115337","text":": The "},{"id":"spn-115338","marks":["code"],"text":"/play"},{"id":"spn-115339","text":" implementation in "},{"id":"spn-115340","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/"},{"id":"spn-115341","text":" is the proven pattern to port from"}]}],"id":"blk-83180","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera22hy2j2ofunz77on54ew2jcxgxlbrzabh2iwxtqrgyo7k234f4hq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}